  "solution": {
    "text": "The minimum distance between two curves lies along their common normal.<br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Then, the equation of normal at <math><mi>P</mi></math><br />is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />this passes through the centre of the circle, hence,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />Minimum distance = distance between&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  }
